            },
            "reviewBody": "It was alright, strong flavor veggie. I did change this a bit. I boiled for 5 minutes, cooked in the pan for 7 and it came out gorgeous.To clean them, first I washed them in cold water, very gently rubbing the brown stuff off each one so only the green remained.",
